libevt
------------------------------------------
libevt is a library to access the Windows Event Log (EVT) format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdirectory1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath1-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libevt-devel-20260705-1bl1
  libevt1-20260705-1bl1
  libexe1-20260705-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfwevt1-20260702-1bl1
  libfwnt1-20260602-1bl1
  libregf1-20260526-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  libwrc1-20260705-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

