Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libevt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libevt/archive/refs/tags/20260705.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libevt-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libevt-20260705-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libevt-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevt-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevt1-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevt-devel-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libevt-20260705-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libevt)
  /usr/bin/evtexport.exe
  /usr/bin/evtinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libevt.README
  /usr/share/doc/libevt/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libevt/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libevt/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libevt/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libevt/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/evtexport.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/evtinfo.1.gz

(libevt1)
  /usr/bin/cygevt-1.dll

(libevt-devel)
  /usr/include/libevt.h
  /usr/include/libevt/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libevt/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libevt/error.h
  /usr/include/libevt/extern.h
  /usr/include/libevt/features.h
  /usr/include/libevt/types.h
  /usr/lib/libevt.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libevt.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libevt.3.gz

(python312-libevt)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyevt.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

